# Cave Hop, a clean run: hop onto the ledge for the coins, hop over the slime
# pit and the spikes, hop up the bricks to the gem, then pick up the last
# coins. Coins are 10 points each, the gem is 50, and nothing hurts.
# (Jumps are "press, wait 30, release": hold the knob for a full-height jump.)

tilt 1 0           # run right the whole way
expect score == 0
expect count.coin == 7

# 1. Jump onto the ledge and run along it: all four ledge coins.
wait 20
press
wait 30
release
wait 30
expect player.ground == 1
expect score == 40
expect count.coin == 3

# 2. Fall off the ledge onto the first brick, then jump the slime pit.
wait 36
press
wait 30
release
wait 24
expect player.ground == 1
expect hurts == 0
expect count.slime == 1

# 3. Jump from the brick over the spikes onto the stairs.
press
wait 30
release
wait 30
expect player.ground == 1
expect hurts == 0

# 4. Jump the stairs: the gem is worth 50 and goes away.
press
wait 30
release
wait 30
expect score == 90
expect count.gem == 0

# 5. Run on to the coins on the ground.
wait 60
expect score == 120
expect count.coin == 0
expect hurts == 0
